---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="404｜页面暂时离线 · 赵天琦"
  description="你访问的页面不存在，可以返回作品集首页或浏览全部项目。"
  pageTag="SYSTEM 404"
>
  <section class="error-page">
    <div class="error-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="error-orbit" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><i></i><b></b></div>
    <div class="shell error-content" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow"><i></i>CONNECTION LOST</span>
      <div class="error-code">
        <span>4</span><div class="error-face" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><b></b></div><span
          >4</span
        >
      </div>
      <h1>这个节点暂时不在系统里。</h1>
      <p>可能是链接更新了，也可能是项目还在另一个时间线。你可以返回首页，或继续浏览全部项目。</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button button-primary" href="/">返回首页</a><a
          class="button button-secondary"
          href="/projects">查看项目</a
        >
      </div>
      <small>ERROR_CODE: PAGE_NOT_FOUND / ROUTE_RECONNECT_AVAILABLE</small>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
